# Up the CD block hub's lift, looking round level all the way (the user, 2026-11-18: from the lift
# "you cannot see much of the city, and the quads don't span the whole city - they also pop in /out
# of view"; "the watchdogs are very visible - but the city paths which they patrol isn't"; the sound
# landmark "too close, it needs to be behind the background city"). Booted 150 short of the pad facing
# west; onto it, then a turn in steps as it rises (a shot after each), and a full turn at the top
